
@host = https://www.kiand.it
@deviceId = 48CA43598F54
@state = LEFT

@updatetask = {"Side":"LEFT","Name":"Riunione-S3","Type":"RIUNIONE"}

#### RegisterDevice
GET {{host}}/cube365/api/statistic.php?Action=RegisterDevice&DeviceId={{deviceId}}
 

#### UpdateState
POST {{host}}/cube365/api/statistic.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Action=UpdateState&DeviceId={{deviceId}}&State={{state}}

### GetTasks
POST {{host}}/cube365/api/statistic.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded 

Action=GetTasks&DeviceId={{deviceId}}

### SendTask
POST {{host}}/cube365/api/statistic.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Action=SendTask&DeviceId={{deviceId}}&Task={{updatetask}}


### SendLog
POST {{host}}/cube365/api/statistic.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Action=SendLog&DeviceId={{deviceId}}&Level=INFO&Message=Test&Value=123

